source: crates/skm-cli/tests/v1.rs
expression: human
---
$ skm list
KIND	NAME	DESCRIPTION
skill	review	Review code

$ skm list --kind skill --scope global
KIND	NAME	DESCRIPTION

$ skm show review
skill review
Review code
{"kind":"skill","name":"review","description":"Review code","path":"<ROOT>/manager/library/skills/review","metadata":{"name":"review","description":"Review code","license":null,"compatibility":null,"metadata":{},"allowed-tools":null},"source":null,"active":[],"problems":[]}

$ skm status
1 items, 1 projects, 0 pending
[] enabled agents

$ skm set list
toolkit

$ skm set show toolkit
{"skills":["review"]}

$ skm project list
PATH	MODE	AUTO-SYNC
<ROOT>/project	Copy	true

$ skm doctor
home: <ROOT>/manager
library: <ROOT>/manager/library
cache: <ROOT>/manager/cache
trash: <ROOT>/manager/trash
